# External User Documentation

## Who this is for

1. Engineers and technical writers publishing docs for platform users.
2. Service teams onboarding product, API, guideline, or runbook content.
3. Reviewers and content owners responsible for quality and lifecycle management.

## End-to-end contributor journey

```mermaid
flowchart TB
	A[Read Getting Started guidance] --> B[Plan content using structure standards]
	B --> C[Draft content using templates]
	C --> D[Apply writing and accessibility standards]
	D --> E[Run preview and link validation]
	E --> F[Open pull request]
	F --> G[Review and ownership checks]
	G --> H[Merge and publish]
```

